  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Measurement of learning outcomes in a multi-topic survey (MICS) and advocating for the use of learning assessment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the effectiveness and impact of foundational learning measurement by validating and aligning the new FLM 2.0 module at lower and upper primary with existing frameworks,  while ensuring comparability over time and between the tools, and strengthening advocacy through targeted research materials as well as the launch of a unified Learning and Skills Data Lab to centralize and elevate assessment data globally</narrative>
  </description>
